WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.468
-Today the house held

00:00:02.468 --> 00:00:04.370
its third day
of public impeachment hearings

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:06.939
and heard from two witnesses
with firsthand knowledge

00:00:06.939 --> 00:00:08.908
of President Trump's phone call
with the president of Ukraine.

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:10.776
For more on this, it's time
for "A Closer Look."

00:00:10.776 --> 00:00:15.014 line:0%
[ Suspenseful theme plays ]
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:15.014 --> 00:00:17.283
It is safe to say that,
politically speaking,

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:19.251
these hearings have been
very bad for President Trump.

00:00:19.251 --> 00:00:22.956
70% of Americans now say
Trump's actions towards Ukraine

00:00:22.956 --> 00:00:24.957
were wrong and,
since impeachment began,

00:00:24.957 --> 00:00:27.126
Trump has campaigned
for two Republican candidates

00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:29.762
in deep red states,
both of whom lost.

00:00:29.762 --> 00:00:32.598
Trump even specifically
told voters in those states

00:00:32.598 --> 00:00:34.334
that he needed them
to vote Republican

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:36.335
to send a message
that they still support him.

00:00:36.335 --> 00:00:38.571
-The headlines the next day:
"Trump Took Loss."

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:40.172
I lift 'em up a lot.

00:00:40.172 --> 00:00:43.009
So Trump took loss, so you gotta
give me a big win, please, okay?

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:45.111
[ Cheering and applause ]
Okay?

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:46.812
-Why does he talk
to his own supporters

00:00:46.812 --> 00:00:47.847
like they're children?

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:49.015
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:50.616
He sounds like
a degenerate gambler

00:00:50.616 --> 00:00:52.718
who bet on his kid's
Little League game.

00:00:52.718 --> 00:00:54.187
[as Trump]
"Come on, Tyler.

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:55.554
You've gotta give
Daddy a win.

00:00:55.554 --> 00:00:57.356
[ Laughter and applause ]
If you don't think

00:00:57.356 --> 00:00:58.725
you can get a hit,
just lean in

00:00:58.725 --> 00:01:00.727
and take a pitch
off your noggin, Tyler.

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:02.895
[ Laughter and applause ]
We need this, Tyler.

00:01:02.895 --> 00:01:07.633
[ Applause and cheering ]

00:01:07.633 --> 00:01:10.069
And Trump's reaction
to the impeachment hearing

00:01:10.069 --> 00:01:11.537
has only made things worse.

00:01:11.537 --> 00:01:14.106
Last week, Trump attacked the
former ambassador to Ukraine,

00:01:14.106 --> 00:01:16.408
Marie Yovanovitch, on Twitter,
during her testimony,

00:01:16.408 --> 00:01:19.745
which legal analysts said could
constitute witness tampering.

00:01:19.745 --> 00:01:21.747
So, in advance
of today's hearing,

00:01:21.747 --> 00:01:24.450
anchors on Trump's favorite
TV channel, Fox News,

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:27.686
begged him not to tweet, or even
watch the hearings at all.

00:01:27.686 --> 00:01:31.056
-If I were Trump, I wouldn't
even talk about impeachment.

00:01:31.056 --> 00:01:32.491
I wouldn't tweet about it.

00:01:32.491 --> 00:01:34.193
-President should just ignore
this whole thing.

00:01:34.193 --> 00:01:35.327
Don't tweet during it.

00:01:35.327 --> 00:01:37.296
Don't get outraged over it.
It ticks ya off.

00:01:37.296 --> 00:01:38.964
-Think about that:
Fox News anchors

00:01:38.964 --> 00:01:41.768
are telling the president
to ignore the hearings,

00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:43.436
[ Laughter ]
even though Fox News

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:45.004
is airing those same
impeachment hearings.

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:46.138
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.138 --> 00:01:48.307
Fox is telling viewers not
to watch them.

00:01:48.307 --> 00:01:50.009
Soon, they're gonna put up
a banner that says,

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:51.143
"Change the channel.

00:01:51.143 --> 00:01:52.544
Nickelodeon has cartoons."

00:01:52.544 --> 00:01:54.547
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:58.184
At this point, Trump's aides
are gonna have to distract him

00:01:58.184 --> 00:02:01.220
from the hearings by sending him
on a scavenger hunt.

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:03.489
"Okay, Donald, there's
a free chicken nugget

00:02:03.489 --> 00:02:04.890
hidden somewhere
in the White House.

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:06.358
[ Laughter and applause ]
[as Trump] Oh. Oh, I bet it's

00:02:06.358 --> 00:02:08.728
in the secret vault where we hid
the incriminating phone call

00:02:08.728 --> 00:02:09.862
with the president of Ukraine.

00:02:09.862 --> 00:02:10.930
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:13.065
I'm comin' for you, nugget.

00:02:13.065 --> 00:02:15.001
[ Laughter ]
In fact, the public hearings

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:16.635
are going so badly for Trump

00:02:16.635 --> 00:02:18.771
that Republicans
who spent weeks complaining

00:02:18.771 --> 00:02:20.606
the initial depositions
were being held in private

00:02:20.606 --> 00:02:22.108
are now going back

00:02:22.108 --> 00:02:24.644
to say this should all be
handled behind closed doors.

00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:27.547
Here is Wisconsin
Senator Ron Johnson on Sunday.

00:02:27.547 --> 00:02:30.149
-One thing I wanna point out is
the damage that's being done

00:02:30.149 --> 00:02:32.919
to our country through this
entire impeachment process.

00:02:32.919 --> 00:02:35.388
Those individuals
that leaked this, you know,

00:02:35.388 --> 00:02:38.658
if their interest was a stronger
relationship with Ukraine,

00:02:38.658 --> 00:02:39.692
they didn't accomplish this.

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:41.660
Having this all come out
in the public

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:43.095
has weakened that relationship.

00:02:43.095 --> 00:02:45.498
It has exposed things that
didn't need to be exposed.

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:47.433
So, this would have been
far better off

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:50.203
if we woulda just taken care
of this behind the scenes.

00:02:50.203 --> 00:02:51.871
-Oh, would that have been
better for you?

00:02:51.871 --> 00:02:53.005
Now that it's embarrassing,

00:02:53.005 --> 00:02:54.340
[ Laughter ]
you want to take care of it

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:55.541
behind the scenes?

00:02:55.541 --> 00:02:57.377
[ Laughter, clapping ]
What does that even mean?

00:02:57.377 --> 00:02:58.945
"Look, let's just settle
this in private

00:02:58.945 --> 00:03:01.180
over a few beers
with an arm wrestling contest.

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:02.714
Whoever wins --
Oh, damn it!"

00:03:02.714 --> 00:03:04.783
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:04.783 --> 00:03:07.019
[as Trump]
Best of luck Nancy. Oh!

00:03:07.019 --> 00:03:09.355
[ Laughter ]
Damn you, baby arms.

00:03:09.355 --> 00:03:10.823
[ Fresh laughter ]

00:03:10.823 --> 00:03:12.224
And after
this morning's hearing,

00:03:12.224 --> 00:03:14.861
you can see why Republicans
wanted to handle impeachment

00:03:14.861 --> 00:03:17.430
behind the scenes: Because it's
been devastating for them.

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:19.599
Today's first witnesses
were Jennifer Williams,

00:03:19.599 --> 00:03:21.701
the Russia advisor
to Vice President Mike Pence,

00:03:21.701 --> 00:03:23.502
who's worked for other
Republican presidents;

00:03:23.502 --> 00:03:25.404
and Lieutenant Colonel
Alexander Vindman,

00:03:25.404 --> 00:03:27.907
the top Ukraine expert
on the National Security Council

00:03:27.907 --> 00:03:29.007
and a decorated war veteran.

00:03:29.007 --> 00:03:30.276
They both heard

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:31.977
Trump's phone call
with the president of Ukraine.

00:03:31.977 --> 00:03:33.779
Vindman, for example,
said he reported the call

00:03:33.779 --> 00:03:34.947
out of a sense of duty

00:03:34.947 --> 00:03:36.516
because it was inappropriate
and improper.

00:03:36.516 --> 00:03:38.084
Both witnesses
could also provide

00:03:38.084 --> 00:03:40.352
direct firsthand knowledge
of even the smallest details

00:03:40.352 --> 00:03:42.421
from the phone calls,
like, for example,

00:03:42.421 --> 00:03:43.990
the languages that were spoken.

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:46.692
-July 25th
at approximately 9:00 am.

00:03:46.692 --> 00:03:49.728
You both were sitting
in the situation room

00:03:49.728 --> 00:03:52.131
and you were preparing
for a long-awaited phone call

00:03:52.131 --> 00:03:55.234
between President Trump
and President Zelensky.

00:03:55.234 --> 00:03:56.735
Do you recall what language

00:03:56.735 --> 00:04:01.708
President Zelensky spoke
on this July 25th phone call?

00:04:01.708 --> 00:04:04.911
-I know he made a valiant
effort to speak English.

00:04:04.911 --> 00:04:06.679
He'd been practicing up
his English.

00:04:06.679 --> 00:04:08.147
-Now, of course,
he could've been referring

00:04:08.147 --> 00:04:09.615
to the president of Ukraine
or the president

00:04:09.615 --> 00:04:12.184
of the United States.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:12.184 --> 00:04:14.020
"Mr. Chairman,
President Trump

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:15.922
tried to brush up on his
English, but, unfortunately,

00:04:15.922 --> 00:04:17.289
he still hasn't learned how

00:04:17.289 --> 00:04:19.124
to spell his own name
right in tweets.

00:04:19.124 --> 00:04:20.760
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:22.995
[as Trump] Hello.
This is President Tehtum.

00:04:22.995 --> 00:04:25.498
[ Laughter ]
Yes, of the united to dates.

00:04:25.498 --> 00:04:28.134
[ Fresh laughter ]

00:04:28.134 --> 00:04:30.370
Williams also testified directly
about what she heard

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:33.172
on that call and she said that
she was concerned about it.

00:04:33.172 --> 00:04:36.542
-I found the July 25th
phone call unusual because,

00:04:36.542 --> 00:04:38.277
in contrast to other
presidential calls

00:04:38.277 --> 00:04:40.779
I had observed,
it involved discussion

00:04:40.779 --> 00:04:43.249
of what appeared to be
a domestic political matter.

00:04:43.249 --> 00:04:44.683
-That's right.
The call was unusual,

00:04:44.683 --> 00:04:46.752
both because the president
of the United States pressured

00:04:46.752 --> 00:04:49.121
a foreign country to interfere
in the 2020 election

00:04:49.121 --> 00:04:51.056
and also because
it was Donald Trump

00:04:51.056 --> 00:04:53.426
and everything he does
is unusual.

00:04:53.426 --> 00:04:56.261
Even the way he poses
for photos is unusual.

00:04:56.261 --> 00:04:58.398
I mean --
[ Laughter ]

00:04:58.398 --> 00:05:01.400
Look at him.
He sways back and forth

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:03.368
[ Laughter and applause ]
like a 10-year-old

00:05:03.368 --> 00:05:04.837
who really has to pee.

00:05:04.837 --> 00:05:07.206
[as Trump] Uh, uh,

00:05:07.206 --> 00:05:10.108
Pence told you to go
before the picture.

00:05:10.108 --> 00:05:11.377
Why didn't you listen?

00:05:11.377 --> 00:05:14.046
Why didn't you listen and go
before the picture?

00:05:14.046 --> 00:05:15.748
[ Laughter ]

00:05:15.748 --> 00:05:18.150
Now, Williams is an advisor
to the vice president

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:20.019
of the United States
and she heard the call herself

00:05:20.019 --> 00:05:21.921
and, yet,
Trump attacked her Sunday,

00:05:21.921 --> 00:05:23.556
on Twitter, writing,
"Tell Jennifer Williams

00:05:23.556 --> 00:05:24.991
whoever that is,

00:05:24.991 --> 00:05:27.059
to read BOTH transcripts
of the presidential calls."

00:05:27.059 --> 00:05:28.394
What do you mean,
"whoever that is"?

00:05:28.394 --> 00:05:29.896
She's an advisor
to the vice president.

00:05:29.896 --> 00:05:31.330
Soon, Trump's
gonna start pretending

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:33.065
he never even met Mike Pence.
[as Trump] "Oh, that guy?

00:05:33.065 --> 00:05:34.767
I thought that guy was
a Halloween decoration.

00:05:34.767 --> 00:05:36.368
[ Laughter and applause ]
I --

00:05:36.368 --> 00:05:38.838
I put a bucket of candy in his
lap for trick-or-treaters.

00:05:38.838 --> 00:05:40.272
[ Fresh laughter ]

00:05:40.272 --> 00:05:42.174
Now, in advance of the hearings,
Republicans have tried

00:05:42.174 --> 00:05:43.976
to impugn the integrity
and character

00:05:43.976 --> 00:05:44.977
of Lieutenant Colonel Vindman.

00:05:44.977 --> 00:05:45.978
Yesterday, for example,

00:05:45.978 --> 00:05:47.347
Wisconsin Senator Ron Johnson,

00:05:47.347 --> 00:05:49.348
who we mentioned earlier,
wrote a letter

00:05:49.348 --> 00:05:51.517
suggesting Vindman was
trying to sabotage Trump,

00:05:51.517 --> 00:05:53.719
although he had
no proof, whatsoever.

00:05:53.719 --> 00:05:56.588
-Johnson writes this:
"A significant number

00:05:56.588 --> 00:06:00.492
of bureaucrats and staff members
within the executive branch

00:06:00.492 --> 00:06:03.595
have never accepted
President Trump as legitimate

00:06:03.595 --> 00:06:05.631
and resent his unorthodox style

00:06:05.631 --> 00:06:08.667
and his intrusion
onto their 'turf.'

00:06:08.667 --> 00:06:11.571
They react by leaking
to the press and participating

00:06:11.571 --> 00:06:15.674
in the ongoing effort
to sabotage his policies

00:06:15.674 --> 00:06:18.010
and, if possible,
remove him from office.

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:22.448
It is entirely possible that
Vindman fits this profile."

00:06:22.448 --> 00:06:24.383
-You think he's trying
to sabotage Trump?

00:06:24.383 --> 00:06:26.352
The only person who's trying
to sabotage Donald Trump

00:06:26.352 --> 00:06:27.586
is Donald Trump.

00:06:27.586 --> 00:06:29.255
[ Laughter ]
I mean, the guy commits crimes,

00:06:29.255 --> 00:06:31.090
then goes on TV
and confesses to them.

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:33.458
Honestly, there's a chance
he's trying to get impeached

00:06:33.458 --> 00:06:34.960
so he can collect unemployment.

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:35.994
[ Laughter ]
[as Trump] Check it out.

00:06:35.994 --> 00:06:37.263
Now that I've been fired,

00:06:37.263 --> 00:06:39.065
I get two weeks severance,
plus COBRA.

00:06:39.065 --> 00:06:41.033
[ Laughter ]

00:06:41.033 --> 00:06:42.401
Conservatives on Fox
and elsewhere

00:06:42.401 --> 00:06:44.870
have also claimed that,
because Vindman speaks Ukrainian

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:46.439
and because he came here
as a refugee

00:06:46.439 --> 00:06:48.573
when he was three years old,
he somehow has more

00:06:48.573 --> 00:06:50.642
of an allegiance to Ukraine
than the United States.

00:06:50.642 --> 00:06:53.913
For example, the GOP lawyer
assigned to question Vindman

00:06:53.913 --> 00:06:56.682
brought up a job offer
Vindman had apparently received

00:06:56.682 --> 00:06:57.950
from a Ukrainian official,

00:06:57.950 --> 00:07:01.353
a job offer Vindman
immediately dismissed as comical

00:07:01.353 --> 00:07:02.955
and reported to his superiors.

00:07:02.955 --> 00:07:05.724
-Did Mr. Danylyuk offer you
a position of defense minister

00:07:05.724 --> 00:07:06.859
-[Laughs]
-with the Ukrainian government?

00:07:06.859 --> 00:07:07.960
-He did.

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:09.728
-And how many times
did he do that?

00:07:09.728 --> 00:07:11.497
-I believe it was three times.

00:07:11.497 --> 00:07:14.900
-And do you have any reason
why he asked you to do that?

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:18.837
-I don't know, but, every
single time, I dismissed it.

00:07:18.837 --> 00:07:21.440
-When he made this offer
to you initially,

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:23.142
did you leave the door open?
Was there a reason

00:07:23.142 --> 00:07:25.644
that he had to come back
and ask a second and third time,

00:07:25.644 --> 00:07:27.279
or was he just trying
to convince ya?

00:07:27.279 --> 00:07:28.780
-Counsel, you know what?

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:31.650
The whole notion
is rather comical.

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:33.286
I did not leave the door
open at all.

00:07:33.286 --> 00:07:35.821
-When he made this offer to you,

00:07:35.821 --> 00:07:37.623
was he speaking in English
or Ukrainian?

00:07:37.623 --> 00:07:41.059
-Oh, Mr. Danylyuk
is a absolutely flawless

00:07:41.059 --> 00:07:42.728
English speaker.
He was speaking in English.

00:07:42.728 --> 00:07:44.629
-And that would be memorable,
of course, 'cause it's rare

00:07:44.629 --> 00:07:45.865
for anyone
in the Trump White House

00:07:45.865 --> 00:07:47.666
to hear someone speak
flawless English.

00:07:47.666 --> 00:07:48.968
I mean, Trump knows
like five words,

00:07:48.968 --> 00:07:50.902
Pence doesn't speak at all,
and I'm pretty sure

00:07:50.902 --> 00:07:53.172
[ Laughter ]
Stephen Miller only communicates
in demonic screams.

00:07:53.172 --> 00:07:55.274
[ Fresh laughter ]

00:07:55.274 --> 00:07:56.275
How are ya, Stephen?

00:07:56.275 --> 00:07:58.778
-Aaaaaaaaaaah!

00:07:58.778 --> 00:07:59.911
[ Laughter ]

00:07:59.911 --> 00:08:01.814
It's true.
You are a racist.

00:08:01.814 --> 00:08:05.250
[ Laughter ]
But, today

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:07.520
during the hearing,
Vindman courageously rebuffed

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:09.455
any suggestion
that he was somehow loyal

00:08:09.455 --> 00:08:11.256
to any country other
than the U.S.

00:08:11.256 --> 00:08:13.492
and there was one moment
where he reminded

00:08:13.492 --> 00:08:16.895
GOP Congressman Devin Nunes
of his Army rank.

00:08:16.895 --> 00:08:19.531
-Mr. Vindman, you testified
in your deposition

00:08:19.531 --> 00:08:22.034
that you did not know
the whistleblower.

00:08:22.034 --> 00:08:25.004
-Ranking Member, it's Lieutenant
Colonel Vindman, please.

00:08:25.004 --> 00:08:26.405
-Lieutenant Colonel Vindman.

00:08:26.405 --> 00:08:29.174
-[as Nunes] Uh uh uh uh -- D'oh!
[ Laughter ]

00:08:29.174 --> 00:08:30.876
Ih ooh uh.

00:08:30.876 --> 00:08:32.177
Look at Nunes' face.

00:08:32.177 --> 00:08:34.012
I'd say he's bewildered,
but he always looks like that.

00:08:34.012 --> 00:08:36.015
[ Laughter ]
Nunes looks like a waiter

00:08:36.015 --> 00:08:37.650
who just realized
he forgot the specials.

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:39.184
[ Laughter ]

00:08:39.184 --> 00:08:40.419
[as Nunes]
Uh, uh, we --

00:08:40.419 --> 00:08:41.720
Huhhhh.

00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:43.522
[ Laughter ]
We have a fish.

00:08:43.522 --> 00:08:44.623
It, um --

00:08:44.623 --> 00:08:45.691
[ Laughter ]

00:08:45.691 --> 00:08:49.629
[ Fresh laughter ]

00:08:49.629 --> 00:08:51.697
It -- It come--
It comes on a plate.

00:08:51.697 --> 00:08:53.866
[ Laughter ]
Now, while this was happening,

00:08:53.866 --> 00:08:55.867
Trump was asked
about Vindman's testimony

00:08:55.867 --> 00:08:58.537
and Trump claimed he had
no idea who Vindman was.

00:08:58.537 --> 00:09:00.005
[ Camera shutter clicking ]
-Thank you for asking.

00:09:00.005 --> 00:09:01.239
-I don't know him.

00:09:01.239 --> 00:09:03.642
I don't know, as he says,
the Lieutenant Colonel.

00:09:03.642 --> 00:09:05.310
I understand somebody
had the misfortune

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:07.846
of calling him mister
and he corrected them.

00:09:07.846 --> 00:09:09.615
I never saw the man.
I understand, now,

00:09:09.615 --> 00:09:11.117
he wears his uniform
when he goes in.

00:09:11.117 --> 00:09:13.019
No, I don't know Vindman at all.

00:09:13.019 --> 00:09:17.656
But Vindman, I watched him
for a little while this morning

00:09:17.656 --> 00:09:20.760
and I think he --

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:23.795
I'm gonna let people make
their own determination,

00:09:23.795 --> 00:09:25.363
but I don't know Vindman.

00:09:25.363 --> 00:09:26.766
I never heard of him.

00:09:26.766 --> 00:09:29.001
-What?
You never heard of him?!

00:09:29.001 --> 00:09:30.937
I mean, it's one thing
to say you've never met him,

00:09:30.937 --> 00:09:33.205
but he's been
in the news for weeks!

00:09:33.205 --> 00:09:34.439
[ Laughter ]
I mean, I've never watched

00:09:34.439 --> 00:09:36.575
"The Masked Singer,"
but I know it's a TV show.

00:09:36.575 --> 00:09:38.377
[ Laughter, clapping ]

00:09:38.377 --> 00:09:39.778
During his Q&amp;A with reporters,

00:09:39.778 --> 00:09:41.780
Trump also attacked
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi

00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:43.549
for moving forward
with impeachment.

00:09:43.549 --> 00:09:45.751
-The woman is
grossly incompetent.

00:09:45.751 --> 00:09:48.620
All she wants to do
is focus on impeachment,

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:51.090
which is just a little
pipe dream she's got.

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:53.392
What's going on is a disgrace

00:09:53.392 --> 00:09:55.627
and it's an embarrassment
to our nation

00:09:55.627 --> 00:09:58.897
and, in the meantime,
we can't get USMCA approved

00:09:58.897 --> 00:10:01.767
because Nancy Pelosi
is grossly incompetent.

00:10:01.767 --> 00:10:03.101
She is incompetent.

00:10:03.101 --> 00:10:04.770
-She's incompetent?!
You failed

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:06.338
at almost everything
you've done in your life.

00:10:06.338 --> 00:10:08.740
You won an election where
you got the second-most votes

00:10:08.740 --> 00:10:10.843
and you spend most of your time
wandering in circles

00:10:10.843 --> 00:10:12.478
around the White House lawn,

00:10:12.478 --> 00:10:14.180
[ Laughter ]
like a kid waiting for his mom

00:10:14.180 --> 00:10:15.414
to pick him up from school.

00:10:15.414 --> 00:10:16.882
[ Fresh laughter and applause ]

00:10:16.882 --> 00:10:19.051
I mean, look at him.

00:10:19.051 --> 00:10:20.185
Look at that.

00:10:20.185 --> 00:10:24.423
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:10:24.423 --> 00:10:25.924
I thought he had
his own helicopter.

00:10:25.924 --> 00:10:27.793
He looks like he's
waitin' for the bus.

00:10:27.793 --> 00:10:29.628
[ Laughter ]
He should be takin' a drag

00:10:29.628 --> 00:10:31.230
off a cigarette, goin',
"Screw it.

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:32.931
I'm walkin'.
The MTA sucks."

00:10:32.931 --> 00:10:34.266
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:34.266 --> 00:10:37.068
When their attacks on Vindman's
credibility didn't work,

00:10:37.068 --> 00:10:40.172
GOP Congressman John Ratcliffe
shifted tactics

00:10:40.172 --> 00:10:42.541
and tried to claim
that no one who testified

00:10:42.541 --> 00:10:44.744
had ever specifically
used the word bribery

00:10:44.744 --> 00:10:46.244
in any of their depositions.

00:10:46.244 --> 00:10:49.248
-No witness
has used the word bribery

00:10:49.248 --> 00:10:51.583
to describe
President Trump's conduct.

00:10:51.583 --> 00:10:52.752
None of them.

00:10:54.486 --> 00:10:59.358
These aren't all of the
deposition transcripts.

00:10:59.358 --> 00:11:01.627
These are just the ten
that have been released.

00:11:01.627 --> 00:11:03.795
The number of times witnesses

00:11:03.795 --> 00:11:06.531
have used the word
bribery or bribe

00:11:06.531 --> 00:11:09.368
to describe
President Trump's conduct

00:11:09.368 --> 00:11:13.305
in the last six weeks
of this inquiry is zero.

00:11:13.305 --> 00:11:14.807
-That's right.
He can't be guilty

00:11:14.807 --> 00:11:16.976
because they didn't use
that exact word?

00:11:16.976 --> 00:11:19.678
Republicans must spend all their
time reading the Federal Code,

00:11:19.678 --> 00:11:21.479
looking for crimes
Trump isn't guilty of.

00:11:21.479 --> 00:11:23.148
"Let's see here.
Extortion? Guilty.

00:11:23.148 --> 00:11:24.750
Uh, fraud?
Oh, he's guilty on that.

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:26.952
What about speeding?
Has he ever run a red light?

00:11:26.952 --> 00:11:27.953
Damn it!"

00:11:27.953 --> 00:11:29.555
[ Laughter ]

00:11:29.555 --> 00:11:30.755
Once again,
this hearing proved

00:11:30.755 --> 00:11:31.924
that Republicans
have no defense.

00:11:31.924 --> 00:11:33.159
All they can do is
attack the witnesses

00:11:33.159 --> 00:11:34.626
because that's what Trump wants.

00:11:34.626 --> 00:11:37.796
I wouldn't be surprised if Trump
called Republicans and Fox News

00:11:37.796 --> 00:11:38.964
before the hearing and said...

00:11:38.964 --> 00:11:41.066
-You gotta give me
a big win, please, okay?

00:11:41.066 --> 00:11:42.601
[ Laughter ]
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:11:42.601 --> 00:11:46.105
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

